<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-FILDERSTADT WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-FILDERSTADT WOMEN'S TOURNAMENT RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>FILDERSTADT, Germany 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the</p>
<p>$450,000 Filderstadt women's tennis tournament on Wednesday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>First round</p>
<p>5-Anke Huber (Germany) beat Elena Wagner (Germany) 6-2 6-1</p>
<p>Second round</p>
<p>1-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain) beat Jennifer Capriati (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-4 6-4</p>
</text>
